    "title": "D1 Baseball Names LSU the No. 1 Program in the Nation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bill Franques ,\n5 hours ago BATON ROUGE, La. – D1 Baseball has named LSU the No. 1 college program in the nation, completing its ranking of the Top 100 College Programs that began in September. LSU was also voted the nation’s No. 1 program in 2024, the last time D1 Baseball released a Top 100 list. Read full article",
